Employee Management System
A simple Employee Management System built using Spring Boot, Spring MVC, Thymeleaf, Spring Data JPA, and H2 Database.

This application demonstrates the complete CRUD (Create, Read, Update, Delete) operations with a frontend developed using Thymeleaf templates and a backend powered by Spring Boot.

Features
✅ Add Employee

✅ Display All Employees

✅ Update Employee Details

✅ Delete Employee

✅ Thymeleaf Integration

✅ Spring Data JPA

✅ H2 In-Memory Database

✅ Responsive UI

✅ MVC Architecture

